{"id":"ca46f081108640e9","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/720_ALCN.md","title":"720 ALCN","display":"720_ALCN","type":"system","metadata":{},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[],"html":"<p><span class=\"inline-tag\">#FormalSystem</span></p>\n<h1 id=\"720-ALCN\">720 ALCN</h1>\n<h1 id=\"1.-原始符号\">1. 原始符号</h1>\n<p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma=(N_C,N_R)\">\\(\\Sigma=(N_C,N_R)\\)</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N_C\">\\(N_C\\)</span> 是概念名集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N_R\">\\(N_R\\)</span> 是角色名集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\}\">\\(\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\}\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>ALCN 的概念构造子为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{name},\\operatorname{top},\\operatorname{bottom},\n\\operatorname{neg},\\operatorname{conj},\\operatorname{disj},\n\\operatorname{forall},\\operatorname{exists},\n\\operatorname{atleast},\\operatorname{atmost}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{name},\\operatorname{top},\\operatorname{bottom},\n\\operatorname{neg},\\operatorname{conj},\\operatorname{disj},\n\\operatorname{forall},\\operatorname{exists},\n\\operatorname{atleast},\\operatorname{atmost}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其型别为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{name}:N_C\\to\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCN}},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{top},\\operatorname{bottom}\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCN}},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{name}:N_C\\to\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCN}},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{top},\\operatorname{bottom}\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCN}},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{neg}:\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCN}}\\to\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCN}},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{neg}:\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCN}}\\to\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCN}},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{conj},\\operatorname{disj}:\n\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCN}}\\times\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCN}}\n\\to\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCN}},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{conj},\\operatorname{disj}:\n\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCN}}\\times\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCN}}\n\\to\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCN}},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{forall},\\operatorname{exists}:\nN_R\\times\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCN}}\n\\to\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCN}},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{forall},\\operatorname{exists}:\nN_R\\times\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCN}}\n\\to\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCN}},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atleast},\\operatorname{atmost}:\n\\mathbb N\\times N_R\\to\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCN}}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{atleast},\\operatorname{atmost}:\n\\mathbb N\\times N_R\\to\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCN}}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>数目限制构造子显示为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\geq nR\">\\(\\geq nR\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\leq nR\">\\(\\leq nR\\)</span>，它们没有填充概念参数。</p>\n<h1 id=\"2.-概念表达式\">2. 概念表达式</h1>\n<p>定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCN}}\">\\(\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCN}}\\)</span> 为满足下列条款的最小集合。</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\top,\\bot\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCN}}\">\\(\\top,\\bot\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCN}}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in N_C\">\\(A\\in N_C\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{name}(A)\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCN}}\">\\(\\operatorname{name}(A)\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCN}}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCN}}\">\\(C\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCN}}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg C\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCN}}\">\\(\\neg C\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCN}}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C,D\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCN}}\">\\(C,D\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCN}}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\\sqcap D\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCN}}\">\\(C\\sqcap D\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCN}}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C,D\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCN}}\">\\(C,D\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCN}}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\\sqcup D\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCN}}\">\\(C\\sqcup D\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCN}}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\in N_R\">\\(R\\in N_R\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCN}}\">\\(C\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCN}}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall R.C\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCN}}\">\\(\\forall R.C\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCN}}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\in N_R\">\\(R\\in N_R\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCN}}\">\\(C\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCN}}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\exists R.C\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCN}}\">\\(\\exists R.C\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCN}}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\in N_R\">\\(R\\in N_R\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\geq nR\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCN}}\">\\(\\geq nR\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCN}}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\in N_R\">\\(R\\in N_R\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\leq nR\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCN}}\">\\(\\leq nR\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCN}}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<h1 id=\"3.-包含式与-TBox\">3. 包含式与 TBox</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Inc}_{\\mathsf{ALCN}}\n=\\{(C,D):C,D\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCN}}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Inc}_{\\mathsf{ALCN}}\n=\\{(C,D):C,D\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCN}}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>TBox 载体为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{TBox}_{\\mathsf{ALCN}}\n=\\{\\mathcal T\\subseteq\\mathsf{Inc}_{\\mathsf{ALCN}}:\\mathcal T\\text{ 有限}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{TBox}_{\\mathsf{ALCN}}\n=\\{\\mathcal T\\subseteq\\mathsf{Inc}_{\\mathsf{ALCN}}:\\mathcal T\\text{ 有限}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"4.-自由名字与替换\">4. 自由名字与替换</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FN}:\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCN}}\\to\\mathcal P(N_C\\cup N_R)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FN}:\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCN}}\\to\\mathcal P(N_C\\cup N_R)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>由下列子句定义：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FN}(\\top)=\\operatorname{FN}(\\bot)=\\varnothing,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FN}(\\top)=\\operatorname{FN}(\\bot)=\\varnothing,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FN}(\\operatorname{name}(A))=\\{A\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FN}(\\operatorname{name}(A))=\\{A\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FN}(\\neg C)=\\operatorname{FN}(C),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FN}(\\neg C)=\\operatorname{FN}(C),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FN}(C\\sqcap D)=\\operatorname{FN}(C)\\cup\\operatorname{FN}(D),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FN}(C\\sqcap D)=\\operatorname{FN}(C)\\cup\\operatorname{FN}(D),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FN}(C\\sqcup D)=\\operatorname{FN}(C)\\cup\\operatorname{FN}(D),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FN}(C\\sqcup D)=\\operatorname{FN}(C)\\cup\\operatorname{FN}(D),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FN}(\\forall R.C)=\\{R\\}\\cup\\operatorname{FN}(C),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FN}(\\forall R.C)=\\{R\\}\\cup\\operatorname{FN}(C),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FN}(\\exists R.C)=\\{R\\}\\cup\\operatorname{FN}(C),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FN}(\\exists R.C)=\\{R\\}\\cup\\operatorname{FN}(C),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FN}(\\geq nR)=\\operatorname{FN}(\\leq nR)=\\{R\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FN}(\\geq nR)=\\operatorname{FN}(\\leq nR)=\\{R\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义无绑定名字函数：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BN}(C)=\\varnothing\n\\quad(C\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCN}}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BN}(C)=\\varnothing\n\\quad(C\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCN}}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对每个名字排序 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\in\\{N_C,N_R\\}\">\\(S\\in\\{N_C,N_R\\}\\)</span> 固定无重复枚举 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e^S_0,e^S_1,\\ldots\">\\(e^S_0,e^S_1,\\ldots\\)</span>。若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\subseteq S\">\\(X\\subseteq S\\)</span> 有限，则</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{fresh}_{\\mathsf{ALCN}}(S,X)=e^S_m,\n\\quad\nm=\\min\\{k:e^S_k\\notin X\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{fresh}_{\\mathsf{ALCN}}(S,X)=e^S_m,\n\\quad\nm=\\min\\{k:e^S_k\\notin X\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>给定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta_C:N_C\\to\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCN}}\">\\(\\theta_C:N_C\\to\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCN}}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta_R:N_R\\to N_R\">\\(\\theta_R:N_R\\to N_R\\)</span>，定义替换：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}(\\top)=\\top,\\quad\\operatorname{Sub}(\\bot)=\\bot,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}(\\top)=\\top,\\quad\\operatorname{Sub}(\\bot)=\\bot,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}(\\operatorname{name}(A))=\\theta_C(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}(\\operatorname{name}(A))=\\theta_C(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}(\\neg C)=\\neg\\operatorname{Sub}(C),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}(\\neg C)=\\neg\\operatorname{Sub}(C),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}(C\\sqcap D)=\\operatorname{Sub}(C)\\sqcap\\operatorname{Sub}(D),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}(C\\sqcap D)=\\operatorname{Sub}(C)\\sqcap\\operatorname{Sub}(D),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}(C\\sqcup D)=\\operatorname{Sub}(C)\\sqcup\\operatorname{Sub}(D),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}(C\\sqcup D)=\\operatorname{Sub}(C)\\sqcup\\operatorname{Sub}(D),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}(\\forall R.C)=\\forall\\theta_R(R).\\operatorname{Sub}(C),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}(\\forall R.C)=\\forall\\theta_R(R).\\operatorname{Sub}(C),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}(\\exists R.C)=\\exists\\theta_R(R).\\operatorname{Sub}(C),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}(\\exists R.C)=\\exists\\theta_R(R).\\operatorname{Sub}(C),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}(\\geq nR)=\\geq n\\theta_R(R),\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Sub}(\\leq nR)=\\leq n\\theta_R(R).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}(\\geq nR)=\\geq n\\theta_R(R),\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Sub}(\\leq nR)=\\leq n\\theta_R(R).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\equiv_\\alpha^{\\mathsf{ALCN}}\n=\n\\{(C,C):C\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCN}}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\equiv_\\alpha^{\\mathsf{ALCN}}\n=\n\\{(C,C):C\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCN}}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall R.C\">\\(\\forall R.C\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\exists R.C\">\\(\\exists R.C\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\geq nR\">\\(\\geq nR\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\leq nR\">\\(\\leq nR\\)</span> 是角色限制构造子，不绑定概念名或角色名；捕获避免重命名就是保持排序的有限支撑替换，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{fresh}_{\\mathsf{ALCN}}\">\\(\\operatorname{fresh}_{\\mathsf{ALCN}}\\)</span> 只用于选择未出现在有限名字集中的新名字。</p>\n<h1 id=\"5.-公理集合\">5. 公理集合</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{ALCN}}(\\mathcal T)\n=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf T}(\\mathcal T)\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{ALCbase}}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\geq}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\leq}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{clash}}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{ALCN}}(\\mathcal T)\n=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf T}(\\mathcal T)\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{ALCbase}}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\geq}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\leq}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{clash}}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf T}(\\mathcal T)=\\mathcal T\">\\(\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf T}(\\mathcal T)=\\mathcal T\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{ALCbase}}\">\\(\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{ALCbase}}\\)</span> 包含：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\{C\\sqsubseteq C,\\ C\\sqsubseteq\\top,\\ \\bot\\sqsubseteq C:C\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCN}}\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\{C\\sqsubseteq C,\\ C\\sqsubseteq\\top,\\ \\bot\\sqsubseteq C:C\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCN}}\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\cup\n\\{C\\sqcap D\\sqsubseteq C,\\ C\\sqcap D\\sqsubseteq D:C,D\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCN}}\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\cup\n\\{C\\sqcap D\\sqsubseteq C,\\ C\\sqcap D\\sqsubseteq D:C,D\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCN}}\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\cup\n\\{C\\sqsubseteq C\\sqcup D,\\ D\\sqsubseteq C\\sqcup D:C,D\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCN}}\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\cup\n\\{C\\sqsubseteq C\\sqcup D,\\ D\\sqsubseteq C\\sqcup D:C,D\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCN}}\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\cup\n\\{C\\sqcap\\neg C\\sqsubseteq\\bot,\\ \\top\\sqsubseteq C\\sqcup\\neg C:C\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCN}}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\cup\n\\{C\\sqcap\\neg C\\sqsubseteq\\bot,\\ \\top\\sqsubseteq C\\sqcup\\neg C:C\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCN}}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>数目公理族为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\geq}\n=\\{\\geq mR\\sqsubseteq\\geq nR:R\\in N_R,\\ n,m\\in\\mathbb N,\\ n\\leq m\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\geq}\n=\\{\\geq mR\\sqsubseteq\\geq nR:R\\in N_R,\\ n,m\\in\\mathbb N,\\ n\\leq m\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\leq}\n=\\{\\leq nR\\sqsubseteq\\leq mR:R\\in N_R,\\ n,m\\in\\mathbb N,\\ n\\leq m\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\leq}\n=\\{\\leq nR\\sqsubseteq\\leq mR:R\\in N_R,\\ n,m\\in\\mathbb N,\\ n\\leq m\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{clash}}\n=\n\\{(\\geq mR)\\sqcap(\\leq nR)\\sqsubseteq\\bot:R\\in N_R,\\ n,m\\in\\mathbb N,\\ n&lt;m\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{clash}}\n=\n\\{(\\geq mR)\\sqcap(\\leq nR)\\sqsubseteq\\bot:R\\in N_R,\\ n,m\\in\\mathbb N,\\ n&lt;m\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"6.-推理规则\">6. 推理规则</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{tr}}\n=\\{(((C,D),(D,E)),(C,E)):C,D,E\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCN}}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{tr}}\n=\\{(((C,D),(D,E)),(C,E)):C,D,E\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCN}}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\sqcap I}\n=\\{(((C,D),(C,E)),(C,D\\sqcap E)):C,D,E\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCN}}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\sqcap I}\n=\\{(((C,D),(C,E)),(C,D\\sqcap E)):C,D,E\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCN}}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\sqcup E}\n=\\{(((C,E),(D,E)),(C\\sqcup D,E)):C,D,E\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCN}}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\sqcup E}\n=\\{(((C,E),(D,E)),(C\\sqcup D,E)):C,D,E\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCN}}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\forall}\n=\\{(((C,D)),(\\forall R.C,\\forall R.D)):R\\in N_R,\\ C,D\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCN}}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\forall}\n=\\{(((C,D)),(\\forall R.C,\\forall R.D)):R\\in N_R,\\ C,D\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCN}}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\exists}\n=\\{(((C,D)),(\\exists R.C,\\exists R.D)):R\\in N_R,\\ C,D\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCN}}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\exists}\n=\\{(((C,D)),(\\exists R.C,\\exists R.D)):R\\in N_R,\\ C,D\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCN}}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\bot}\n=\\{(((C,\\bot)),(C,D)):C,D\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCN}}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\bot}\n=\\{(((C,\\bot)),(C,D)):C,D\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCN}}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{ALCN}}\n=\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{tr}}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\sqcap I}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\sqcup E}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\forall}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\exists}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\bot}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{ALCN}}\n=\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{tr}}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\sqcap I}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\sqcup E}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\forall}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\exists}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\bot}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"7.-证明对象\">7. 证明对象</h1>\n<p>从 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal T\">\\(\\mathcal T\\)</span> 出发的 ALCN 证明是非空有限序列 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi=(I_0,\\ldots,I_{m-1})\">\\(\\pi=(I_0,\\ldots,I_{m-1})\\)</span>，每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I_i\\in\\mathsf{Inc}_{\\mathsf{ALCN}}\">\\(I_i\\in\\mathsf{Inc}_{\\mathsf{ALCN}}\\)</span>，并且每行满足：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{ALCN}}(\\mathcal T)\">\\(I_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{ALCN}}(\\mathcal T)\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j,k&lt;i\">\\(j,k&lt;i\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((I_j,I_k),I_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{tr}}\">\\(((I_j,I_k),I_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{tr}}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j,k&lt;i\">\\(j,k&lt;i\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((I_j,I_k),I_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\sqcap I}\">\\(((I_j,I_k),I_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\sqcap I}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j,k&lt;i\">\\(j,k&lt;i\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((I_j,I_k),I_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\sqcup E}\">\\(((I_j,I_k),I_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\sqcup E}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j&lt;i\">\\(j&lt;i\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((I_j),I_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\forall}\">\\(((I_j),I_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\forall}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j&lt;i\">\\(j&lt;i\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((I_j),I_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\exists}\">\\(((I_j),I_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\exists}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j&lt;i\">\\(j&lt;i\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((I_j),I_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\bot}\">\\(((I_j),I_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\bot}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>定义证明谓词：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Proof}_{\\mathsf{ALCN}}(\\mathcal T,\\pi,C\\sqsubseteq D)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Proof}_{\\mathsf{ALCN}}(\\mathcal T,\\pi,C\\sqsubseteq D)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi\">\\(\\pi\\)</span> 是满足上述七类行条件且末项为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(C,D)\">\\((C,D)\\)</span> 的非空有限序列。</p>\n<h1 id=\"8.-可导出关系\">8. 可导出关系</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal T\\vdash_{\\mathsf{ALCN}}C\\sqsubseteq D\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal T\\vdash_{\\mathsf{ALCN}}C\\sqsubseteq D\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>当且仅当存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi\">\\(\\pi\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Proof}_{\\mathsf{ALCN}}(\\mathcal T,\\pi,C\\sqsubseteq D)\">\\(\\operatorname{Proof}_{\\mathsf{ALCN}}(\\mathcal T,\\pi,C\\sqsubseteq D)\\)</span>。</p>\n<h1 id=\"9.-语义结构与解释\">9. 语义结构与解释</h1>\n<p>令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{KB}_{\\mathsf{ALCN}}=\n\\{\\mathcal T\\subseteq\\mathsf{Inc}_{\\mathsf{ALCN}}:\\mathcal T\\text{ 有限}\\}\\times\\{\\varnothing\\}\\times\\{\\varnothing\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{KB}_{\\mathsf{ALCN}}=\n\\{\\mathcal T\\subseteq\\mathsf{Inc}_{\\mathsf{ALCN}}:\\mathcal T\\text{ 有限}\\}\\times\\{\\varnothing\\}\\times\\{\\varnothing\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Str}_{\\mathsf{ALCN}}\">\\(\\mathsf{Str}_{\\mathsf{ALCN}}\\)</span> 是所有三元组 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal I=(\\Delta,\\iota_C,\\iota_R)\">\\(\\mathcal I=(\\Delta,\\iota_C,\\iota_R)\\)</span> 的集合，满足</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Delta\\ne\\varnothing,\\quad\n\\iota_C:N_C\\to\\mathcal P(\\Delta),\\quad\n\\iota_R:N_R\\to\\mathcal P(\\Delta\\times\\Delta).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Delta\\ne\\varnothing,\\quad\n\\iota_C:N_C\\to\\mathcal P(\\Delta),\\quad\n\\iota_R:N_R\\to\\mathcal P(\\Delta\\times\\Delta).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\llbracket-\\rrbracket_{\\mathcal I}^{\\mathsf{ALCN}}:\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCN}}\\to\\mathcal P(\\Delta)\">\\(\\llbracket-\\rrbracket_{\\mathcal I}^{\\mathsf{ALCN}}:\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCN}}\\to\\mathcal P(\\Delta)\\)</span>：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\llbracket\\top\\rrbracket=\\Delta,\\quad\n\\llbracket\\bot\\rrbracket=\\varnothing,\\quad\n\\llbracket\\operatorname{name}(A)\\rrbracket=\\iota_C(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\llbracket\\top\\rrbracket=\\Delta,\\quad\n\\llbracket\\bot\\rrbracket=\\varnothing,\\quad\n\\llbracket\\operatorname{name}(A)\\rrbracket=\\iota_C(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\llbracket\\neg C\\rrbracket=\\Delta\\setminus\\llbracket C\\rrbracket,\\quad\n\\llbracket C\\sqcap D\\rrbracket=\\llbracket C\\rrbracket\\cap\\llbracket D\\rrbracket,\\quad\n\\llbracket C\\sqcup D\\rrbracket=\\llbracket C\\rrbracket\\cup\\llbracket D\\rrbracket,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\llbracket\\neg C\\rrbracket=\\Delta\\setminus\\llbracket C\\rrbracket,\\quad\n\\llbracket C\\sqcap D\\rrbracket=\\llbracket C\\rrbracket\\cap\\llbracket D\\rrbracket,\\quad\n\\llbracket C\\sqcup D\\rrbracket=\\llbracket C\\rrbracket\\cup\\llbracket D\\rrbracket,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\llbracket\\forall R.C\\rrbracket=\n\\{x:\\forall y((x,y)\\in\\iota_R(R)\\Rightarrow y\\in\\llbracket C\\rrbracket)\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\llbracket\\forall R.C\\rrbracket=\n\\{x:\\forall y((x,y)\\in\\iota_R(R)\\Rightarrow y\\in\\llbracket C\\rrbracket)\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\llbracket\\exists R.C\\rrbracket=\n\\{x:\\exists y((x,y)\\in\\iota_R(R)\\land y\\in\\llbracket C\\rrbracket)\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\llbracket\\exists R.C\\rrbracket=\n\\{x:\\exists y((x,y)\\in\\iota_R(R)\\land y\\in\\llbracket C\\rrbracket)\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\llbracket\\geq nR\\rrbracket=\\{x:|\\{y:(x,y)\\in\\iota_R(R)\\}|\\geq n\\},\n\\quad\n\\llbracket\\leq nR\\rrbracket=\\{x:|\\{y:(x,y)\\in\\iota_R(R)\\}|\\leq n\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\llbracket\\geq nR\\rrbracket=\\{x:|\\{y:(x,y)\\in\\iota_R(R)\\}|\\geq n\\},\n\\quad\n\\llbracket\\leq nR\\rrbracket=\\{x:|\\{y:(x,y)\\in\\iota_R(R)\\}|\\leq n\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"10.-满足关系与语义后承\">10. 满足关系与语义后承</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal I\\models_{\\mathsf{ALCN}}C\\sqsubseteq D\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\llbracket C\\rrbracket_{\\mathcal I}^{\\mathsf{ALCN}}\\subseteq\n\\llbracket D\\rrbracket_{\\mathcal I}^{\\mathsf{ALCN}}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal I\\models_{\\mathsf{ALCN}}C\\sqsubseteq D\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\llbracket C\\rrbracket_{\\mathcal I}^{\\mathsf{ALCN}}\\subseteq\n\\llbracket D\\rrbracket_{\\mathcal I}^{\\mathsf{ALCN}}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal K\\Vdash_{\\mathsf{ALCN}}I\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathcal K=(\\mathcal T,\\varnothing,\\varnothing)\\land I\\in\\mathsf{Inc}_{\\mathsf{ALCN}}\\land\n\\forall\\mathcal I\\in\\mathsf{Str}_{\\mathsf{ALCN}}\n((\\forall J\\in\\mathcal T\\ \\mathcal I\\models_{\\mathsf{ALCN}}J)\\Rightarrow\n\\mathcal I\\models_{\\mathsf{ALCN}}I).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal K\\Vdash_{\\mathsf{ALCN}}I\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathcal K=(\\mathcal T,\\varnothing,\\varnothing)\\land I\\in\\mathsf{Inc}_{\\mathsf{ALCN}}\\land\n\\forall\\mathcal I\\in\\mathsf{Str}_{\\mathsf{ALCN}}\n((\\forall J\\in\\mathcal T\\ \\mathcal I\\models_{\\mathsf{ALCN}}J)\\Rightarrow\n\\mathcal I\\models_{\\mathsf{ALCN}}I).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"11.-特征差异\">11. 特征差异</h1>\n<p>ALCN 的目标差异对象：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Delta}_{\\mathsf{ALCN}}\n=\n\\bigl(\n\\{\\operatorname{atLeastRole},\\operatorname{atMostRole}\\},\n\\{\\operatorname{atLeastConcept},\\operatorname{atMostConcept},\\operatorname{roleHierarchy},\\operatorname{inv},\\operatorname{nom}\\}\n\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Delta}_{\\mathsf{ALCN}}\n=\n\\bigl(\n\\{\\operatorname{atLeastRole},\\operatorname{atMostRole}\\},\n\\{\\operatorname{atLeastConcept},\\operatorname{atMostConcept},\\operatorname{roleHierarchy},\\operatorname{inv},\\operatorname{nom}\\}\n\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>第一分量中的数目限制不带填充概念，只约束 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span>-后继基数；第二分量排除 ALCQ 的限定数目限制和其他 ALC 扩展构造子。</p>\n<h1 id=\"12.-整个形式系统\">12. 整个形式系统</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal S_{\\mathsf{ALCN}}\n=\n(N_C,N_R,\\mathbb N,\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCN}},\n\\mathsf{Inc}_{\\mathsf{ALCN}},\\mathsf{KB}_{\\mathsf{ALCN}},\n\\operatorname{FN},\\operatorname{BN},\\operatorname{fresh}_{\\mathsf{ALCN}},\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\theta_C,\\theta_R},\\equiv_\\alpha^{\\mathsf{ALCN}},\\mathsf{Delta}_{\\mathsf{ALCN}},\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{ALCN}},\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{ALCN}},\\operatorname{Proof}_{\\mathsf{ALCN}},\n\\vdash_{\\mathsf{ALCN}},\n\\mathsf{Str}_{\\mathsf{ALCN}},\\llbracket-\\rrbracket^{\\mathsf{ALCN}},\n\\models_{\\mathsf{ALCN}},\\Vdash_{\\mathsf{ALCN}}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal S_{\\mathsf{ALCN}}\n=\n(N_C,N_R,\\mathbb N,\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCN}},\n\\mathsf{Inc}_{\\mathsf{ALCN}},\\mathsf{KB}_{\\mathsf{ALCN}},\n\\operatorname{FN},\\operatorname{BN},\\operatorname{fresh}_{\\mathsf{ALCN}},\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\theta_C,\\theta_R},\\equiv_\\alpha^{\\mathsf{ALCN}},\\mathsf{Delta}_{\\mathsf{ALCN}},\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{ALCN}},\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{ALCN}},\\operatorname{Proof}_{\\mathsf{ALCN}},\n\\vdash_{\\mathsf{ALCN}},\n\\mathsf{Str}_{\\mathsf{ALCN}},\\llbracket-\\rrbracket^{\\mathsf{ALCN}},\n\\models_{\\mathsf{ALCN}},\\Vdash_{\\mathsf{ALCN}}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>该系统不含限定数目限制、角色层级、逆角色或名词；语义只解释 ALCN 的非限定数目限制。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"720-ALCN","text":"720 ALCN","level":1},{"id":"1.-原始符号","text":"1. 原始符号","level":1},{"id":"2.-概念表达式","text":"2. 概念表达式","level":1},{"id":"3.-包含式与-TBox","text":"3. 包含式与 TBox","level":1},{"id":"4.-自由名字与替换","text":"4. 自由名字与替换","level":1},{"id":"5.-公理集合","text":"5. 公理集合","level":1},{"id":"6.-推理规则","text":"6. 推理规则","level":1},{"id":"7.-证明对象","text":"7. 证明对象","level":1},{"id":"8.-可导出关系","text":"8. 可导出关系","level":1},{"id":"9.-语义结构与解释","text":"9. 语义结构与解释","level":1},{"id":"10.-满足关系与语义后承","text":"10. 满足